# Projects

This folder contains all my hands-on projects combining AWS, Network Engineering, Cloud Security, and Python Automation.

Each project is structured to showcase:
- Problem statement / objective  
- Architecture or workflow (diagrams optional)  
- Tools and technologies used  
- Implementation steps / scripts  
- Lessons learned

## How Projects are Organized
- Each project has its own subfolder named clearly (e.g., aws-vpc-automation, network-monitoring-tool)  
- Inside each project folder, include:
  - README.md (specific to that project)  
  - Code / scripts  
  - Diagrams or notes if necessary  

## Purpose
This folder demonstrates practical, hands-on experience and is intended for:
- Building a professional portfolio  
- Showcasing real skills to recruiters  
- Documenting applied learning from my 12-month roadmap
